# 🎤 OPIc Experience / Problem-Solution Question - Day36

## Question

Tell me about a time when you had a problem while traveling.
What happened, and how did you solve it?

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- Where you were traveling
- Who you were with
- What problem happened
- How you felt
- What you did to solve it
- How the situation ended

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> The thing is,...

Also try to use:

> Unfortunately,...

> So I decided to...

> Luckily,...

> In the end,...

---

## Recommended Structure

I remember when...

↓

I was traveling...

↓

**The thing is,...**

↓

Unfortunately,...

↓

So I decided to...

↓

Luckily,...

↓

**In the end,...**
